center;\n      left: 24px;\n      bottom: 24px;\n    }\n    .clock:before { width: 2px; height: 17px; transform: rotate(1deg); }\n    .clock:after { width: 2px; height: 11px; transform: rotate(-132deg); }\n    .puzzle {\n      right: 22px;\n      bottom: 24px;\n      width: 86px;\n      height: 86px;\n      border: 4px solid #fff;\n      border-radius: 5px;\n    }\n    .puzzle:before, .puzzle:after {\n      content: \"○\";\n      position: absolute;\n      color: #fff;\n      font-size: 42px;\n      line-height: 20px;\n    }\n    .puzzle:before { left: 6px; top: 5px; }\n    .puzzle:after { right: 5px; bottom: 4px; transform: rotate(180deg); }\n    .speech {\n      right: 31px;\n      top: 61px;\n      width: 62px;\n      height: 57px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: #22bdef;\n    }\n    .speech:after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      bottom: -12px;\n      left: 25px;\n      border-width: 16px 16px 0 0;\n      border-style: solid;\n      border-color: #22bdef transparent transparent transparent;\n    }\n    .handshake {\n      right: 17px;\n      bottom: 27px;\n      font-size: 57px;\n      color: #20c1f5;\n      transform: rotate(-10deg);\n    }\n    .arrow {\n      right: 25px;\n      top: 57px;\n      color: #1fc0f4;\n      font-size: 71px;\n      font-weight: 400;\n    }\n    .star {\n      right: 20px;\n      bottom: 32px;\n      color: #1fc0f4;\n      font-size: 88px;\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n    }\n    .star b {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 31px;\n      top: 30px;\n      font-size: 43px;\n      color: #143d78;\n    }\n    .fist {\n      right: 19px;\n      top: 59px;\n      color: #fff;\n      font-size: 67px;\n      transform: rotate(-8deg);\n    }\n    .profile {\n      right: 25px;\n      bottom: 33px;\n      width: 75px;\n      height: 80px;\n      color: #fff;\n      font-size: 76px;\n    }\n    .profile .cog {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 26px;\n      left: 17px;\n      color: #183b78;\n      font-size: 45px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <section class=\"cover\">\n      <p class=\"organization\">The National Centre<br>for Neurology and Brain<br>Mechanics Presents</p>\n      <h1>Cognitive<br>Dissonance:<br>Performing<br>Menial Tasks</h1>\n      <p class=\"study\">Study conducted by Jonas Festinger,<br>Marcus Carlsmith &amp; Gabriel Chessman</p>\n\n      <div class=\"heads\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <div class=\"head\"><span class=\"face\"></span><span class=\"head-symbol\">⚙</span></div>\n        <div class=\"head\"><span class=\"face\"></span><span class=\"head-symbol\">!</span></div>\n        <div class=\"head question\"><span class=\"face\"></span><span class=\"head-symbol\">?</span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"references\">\n        <div class=\"reference-label\">REFERENCES:</div>\n        Walsh, Karen., Kemptu, Odelle., “The psychology of self-deception”<br>\n        The Anantioc Journal, 2017 • Satuda, Evelyn., “Mertiope, Anya., “Neuroscience<br>\n        of Decision-Making” The Science Review, 2018 • Brahms, Hansen., Leigh.,<br>\n        Anderson., “The Neurobiology for Happiness”, The Arch Journal, 2020\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"content\">\n      <article class=\"panel purpose\">\n        <h2>Purpose:</h2>\n        <p>Festinger, Carlsmith and Chessman wanted to understand if making people perform a menial task would result in cognitive dissonance as a result of forced compliance behavior.</p>\n        <div class=\"icon gear-group\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⚙<span class=\"small\">⚙</span><span class=\"tiny\">⚙</span></div>\n        <div class=\"people icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"person p1\"></span><span class=\"person p2\"></span><span class=\"person p3\"></span></div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"panel hypothesis\">\n        <h2>Hypothesis:</h2>\n        <p>When asked to do an unenjoyable task, people will not readily admit as much, and tell themselves and others it is actually enjoyable.</p>\n        <div class=\"icon thumb\" aria-hidden=\"true\">☝</div>\n        <div class=\"icon scale\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⚖</div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"panel participants\">\n        <h2>Participants:</h2>\n        <p>In a lab setting, 71 male students as participants to perform a series of menial tasks (like turning pegs in a peg board for an hour).</p>\n        <div class=\"clock icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n        <div class=\"puzzle icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"panel method\">\n        <h2>Method:</h2>\n        <p>The participants were then paid either $1 or $20 to tell a waiting participant (a confederate) that the tasks were really engaging and fun. Almost all of the participants agreed to walk into the waiting room and persuade the confederate that the boring experiment would be interesting.</p>\n        <div class=\"speech icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n        <div class=\"handshake icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⌁</div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"panel results\">\n        <h2>Results:</h2>\n        <p>When the participants were asked to evaluate the experiment, the participants who were paid only $1 rated the tedious task as more fun and enjoyable than the participants who were paid $20.</p>\n        <div class=\"arrow icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↑</div>\n        <div class=\"star icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">★<b>+</b></div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"panel conclusion\">\n        <h2>Conclusion:</h2>\n        <p>Getting paid $1 is not sufficient for lying, so those who were paid $1 experienced dissonance. These participants could only overcome that dissonance by coming to believe that the tasks really were interesting and enjoyable.</p>\n        <p>Being paid $20 provides a reason, therefore there is no dissonance.</p>\n        <div class=\"fist icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✊</div>\n        <div class=\"profile icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">●<span class=\"cog\">⚙</span></div>\n      </article>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
